  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/giawbuy.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"281\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HHe76Ki.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"70\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">呱呱！Duckling 是一款為 Minecraft 世界增添活力而加入鴨子的模組！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/duckling/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">要查看 Forge 和 Fabric 的版本，請點選此處。</span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 這個模組新增了什麼？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🦆 白色鴨子和綠頭鴨，它們會在河流生態域中生成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🐥 小鴨商：一種可以交易的漁夫鴨！在沼澤生態域中尋找它們的身影！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🍰 節慶水果蛋糕，小鴨商最愛的甜點！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">🦆&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXC6Xh82yT\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord！</a>&nbsp;🦆</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 鳴謝：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎨 Frogipher#4778（美術設計）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 💻 ThatGravyBoat#0001（程式碼）<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;只要標示出處，Duckling 即可在模組包、YouTube 影片等場合使用。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgravy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f2495544-8c9f-4513-a09d-cac8b85db731.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></span></a></span></p>",
